1
00:00:12,730 --> 00:00:15,550
♪I lean and gaze at misty waves afar♪

2
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:18,320
♪Tears fall on the ancient road
'neath the setting sun♪

3
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:21,460
♪One lone shadow on the cold river♪

4
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:23,910
♪In dreams, I return to the old window♪

5
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:28,670
♪Mountains stretch, the road home fades♪

6
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:32,030
♪A flute cries out, hooves hurry on♪

7
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:34,790
♪My heart adrift beneath a frosted moon♪

8
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:38,220
♪Drinking alone, I mourn our parting♪

9
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:40,050
♪Night turns cold, wind stirs the veil♪

10
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:41,760
♪Old robes recall forgotten days♪

11
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:43,570
♪Heart sore, a lone goose flies south♪

12
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,230
♪Where shall I send this letter?♪

13
00:00:45,230 --> 00:00:47,760
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

14
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:49,000
♪Love runs deep, dreams linger on♪

15
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,390
♪Only sorrow remains♪

16
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:53,340
♪A cup of wine, my shadow makes us two♪

17
00:00:53,350 --> 00:00:54,980
♪Drunk and lost through flashing blades♪

18
00:00:54,990 --> 00:00:56,870
♪I curse how swiftly the years pass by♪

19
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:58,580
♪The wandering road goes on♪

20
00:00:58,590 --> 00:01:01,020
♪Desolate, time frosts my youthful hair♪

21
00:01:01,030 --> 00:01:02,340
♪Through the years, love still burns♪

22
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:04,530
♪A thousand tears fall♪

23
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:08,030
♪Worlds apart, tears stain my sleeves♪

24
00:01:08,150 --> 00:01:11,300
♪Old dreams haunt my heart,
tears cloud my eyes♪

25
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:13,340
♪Heartbroken, soul-worn,
pain won't fade♪

26
00:01:13,340 --> 00:01:14,820
♪Moonlight westward, the night drags on♪

27
00:01:14,830 --> 00:01:17,920
♪The years have left their scars♪

28
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:21,280
♪Autumn winds sweep leaves;
shadows pair♪

29
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:24,590
♪The past fades like smoke;
tears fall♪

30
00:01:24,740 --> 00:01:26,820
♪My heart lies broken♪

31
00:01:26,830 --> 00:01:30,150
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

32
00:01:30,150 --> 00:01:34,980
[Love Legend]

33
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:38,780
[Episode 19]

34
00:01:38,900 --> 00:01:47,100
[Fengyi Bureau]

35
00:02:02,950 --> 00:02:03,590
Wake up.

36
00:02:06,480 --> 00:02:07,150
Have you eaten?

37
00:02:08,470 --> 00:02:09,150
No.

38
00:02:09,470 --> 00:02:09,960
Come.

39
00:02:15,780 --> 00:02:19,810
[Fengyi Bureau]

40
00:02:19,830 --> 00:02:20,400
Come in.

41
00:02:27,430 --> 00:02:28,840
I still remember that day.

42
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:32,560
He ate seven steamed buns.

43
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:35,750
Nearly burst his stomach.

44
00:02:39,590 --> 00:02:40,120
Eggs.

45
00:02:42,190 --> 00:02:42,840
Slow down.

46
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:45,560
Get him some water.

47
00:02:47,990 --> 00:02:48,870
Slow down.

48
00:02:50,930 --> 00:02:52,000
That's your third.

49
00:02:52,130 --> 00:02:53,150
You're scaring me.

50
00:02:55,990 --> 00:02:57,460
Here. Have some water.

51
00:03:03,030 --> 00:03:03,870
Have some pickles.

52
00:03:07,280 --> 00:03:08,840
Been starving, huh?

53
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:11,960
We'll tend your wounds later.

54
00:03:14,590 --> 00:03:15,800
Later, he passed the exam.

55
00:03:17,520 --> 00:03:19,000
He followed me every day.

56
00:03:20,080 --> 00:03:21,150
Always calling me brother.

57
00:03:33,240 --> 00:03:33,910
Thank you, sir.

58
00:03:40,080 --> 00:03:40,680
Keep it up.

59
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:48,750
Everyone in the Fengyi Bureau

60
00:03:49,630 --> 00:03:50,960
loved him.

61
00:03:52,400 --> 00:03:54,150
His parents were Wingless.

62
00:03:56,080 --> 00:03:57,080
They spoke out of turn

63
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:59,080
and offended someone powerful.

64
00:04:01,710 --> 00:04:02,800
Those people

65
00:04:03,440 --> 00:04:04,680
cut out their tongues

66
00:04:06,150 --> 00:04:07,910
right in front of Chang'an.

67
00:04:12,360 --> 00:04:13,520
Everyone, be careful.

68
00:04:15,050 --> 00:04:16,360
Don't let your tears fall on him.

69
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:20,190
Or in his next life,

70
00:04:20,950 --> 00:04:22,720
he may still be born to suffer.

71
00:04:28,540 --> 00:04:29,160
Chang'an.

72
00:04:30,630 --> 00:04:31,830
I'm sorry.

73
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:35,310
I didn't take good care of you.

74
00:04:38,210 --> 00:04:38,800
Listen to me.

75
00:04:40,920 --> 00:04:42,630
Next life, be born into a rich family.

76
00:04:44,120 --> 00:04:46,320
My lord will punish you for coming here.

77
00:04:47,040 --> 00:04:48,960
I'm not actually inside.

78
00:04:50,770 --> 00:04:51,830
Sorry.

79
00:04:51,830 --> 00:04:53,720
You took twenty lashes because of me.

80
00:04:54,100 --> 00:04:55,340
I made you some nourishing soup.

81
00:04:55,700 --> 00:04:58,160
It'll help your wounds heal. Try it.

82
00:04:58,600 --> 00:04:59,910
It's fine. Just a scratch.

83
00:05:00,340 --> 00:05:01,490
Try it while it's hot.

84
00:05:02,540 --> 00:05:06,420
♪A wisp of longing haunts the air♪

85
00:05:06,450 --> 00:05:07,310
Smells great.

86
00:05:07,830 --> 00:05:09,040
Guess I'll dig in.

87
00:05:09,140 --> 00:05:11,810
♪A lone boat rests on the misty river♪

88
00:05:14,240 --> 00:05:15,560
No more suffering.

89
00:05:17,830 --> 00:05:19,070
Not even a little.

90
00:05:20,580 --> 00:05:23,240
You stole that from my room?

91
00:05:23,390 --> 00:05:24,270
A gift from His Majesty.

92
00:05:24,640 --> 00:05:25,430
Jiannan spring wine.

93
00:05:25,510 --> 00:05:26,160
Give it back.

94
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:28,190
It was for Lord Pei's victory feast.

95
00:05:30,430 --> 00:05:31,680
I grew up without parents.

96
00:05:32,480 --> 00:05:33,560
Since I joined Fengyi Bureau,

97
00:05:34,480 --> 00:05:35,940
I finally felt loved.

98
00:05:35,940 --> 00:05:37,390
Ruoming is my real brother to me.

99
00:05:37,400 --> 00:05:38,160
Hit me instead.

100
00:05:45,830 --> 00:05:46,510
Really?

101
00:05:46,920 --> 00:05:48,310
I've never tried a hot spring.

102
00:05:49,970 --> 00:05:50,610
Chang'an.

103
00:05:53,830 --> 00:05:54,950
Let's take you home.

104
00:05:58,680 --> 00:06:00,480
Lu's is a calming bead.

105
00:06:00,480 --> 00:06:01,680
It clears the mind and qi.

106
00:06:02,480 --> 00:06:03,560
Ruoming's is...

107
00:06:09,390 --> 00:06:09,870
Stop it.

108
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:11,360
Since I joined the Fengyi Bureau,

109
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:13,630
I was caned more than anyone.

110
00:06:13,750 --> 00:06:15,120
When Lord Pei gets promoted,

111
00:06:15,310 --> 00:06:17,240
I'll become Chief Commander.

112
00:06:28,600 --> 00:06:29,560
All six offices in the capital

113
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:31,040
are now controlled by Prince of Xin'an.

114
00:06:31,480 --> 00:06:33,430
Wanted notices for us are everywhere.

115
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:36,800
Where is Lord Pei?

116
00:06:36,800 --> 00:06:37,800
At a time like this,

117
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:38,800
he's nowhere to be seen.

118
00:06:42,270 --> 00:06:43,360
Found him?

119
00:07:06,110 --> 00:07:06,700
I'm sorry.

120
00:07:07,680 --> 00:07:09,020
I don't want your apology.

121
00:07:10,400 --> 00:07:11,720
I want the truth.

122
00:07:13,680 --> 00:07:15,040
My birth mother

123
00:07:15,990 --> 00:07:17,080
promised to make it up to me.

124
00:07:18,260 --> 00:07:20,270
I've led the Fengyi Bureau
for over ten years.

125
00:07:20,930 --> 00:07:21,830
I don't want to live as an outlaw.

126
00:07:23,510 --> 00:07:24,510
That's not who you are.

127
00:07:25,430 --> 00:07:26,870
What happened?

128
00:07:31,480 --> 00:07:32,560
Go.

129
00:07:33,310 --> 00:07:34,720
I won't arrest you today.

130
00:07:40,870 --> 00:07:43,040
I want the truth.

131
00:07:43,800 --> 00:07:45,190
That was the truth.

132
00:07:51,490 --> 00:07:52,660
Chang'an is dead.

133
00:07:53,890 --> 00:07:54,640
Did you know?

134
00:07:58,080 --> 00:07:59,000
Everyone dies.

135
00:08:00,800 --> 00:08:01,510
Pei Zhao.

136
00:08:01,510 --> 00:08:02,390
Do you know

137
00:08:03,360 --> 00:08:04,410
when Chang'an died,

138
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:06,750
he was still holding your...

139
00:08:06,750 --> 00:08:07,460
Enough.

140
00:08:10,660 --> 00:08:11,410
Go.

141
00:08:13,500 --> 00:08:14,630
From now on,

142
00:08:15,510 --> 00:08:16,830
we're done.

143
00:08:26,780 --> 00:08:29,700
♪Moonlight sways, flowers scent the air♪

144
00:08:30,100 --> 00:08:33,160
♪Who is singing softly in my heart?♪

145
00:08:33,200 --> 00:08:34,080
There's a wishing tree

146
00:08:34,910 --> 00:08:36,240
east of the city.

147
00:08:36,750 --> 00:08:37,550
I'd like

148
00:08:38,080 --> 00:08:39,240
to take you there.

149
00:08:39,910 --> 00:08:40,660
To make a wish?

150
00:08:40,660 --> 00:08:43,590
♪Fengyi blades lie hidden in the dark♪

151
00:08:43,930 --> 00:08:47,290
♪For one moment, all is lost to love♪

152
00:08:47,730 --> 00:08:51,800
♪Your blade stands shielding by my side♪

153
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:52,910
Getting upset?

154
00:08:57,410 --> 00:09:04,270
♪The crescent moon binds me
to memories past♪

155
00:09:04,460 --> 00:09:10,920
♪Endless bonds,
a mountain we cannot pass♪

156
00:09:11,300 --> 00:09:17,860
♪Meetings and partings
ripple in your eyes♪

157
00:09:18,190 --> 00:09:24,460
♪We shared the storm,
yet cannot cut the ties♪

158
00:09:24,680 --> 00:09:31,520
♪Winds rise, tossing time into chaos♪

159
00:09:31,520 --> 00:09:38,070
♪Love winds around our vows♪

160
00:09:38,410 --> 00:09:45,840
♪For fate, I'd trade for your smile♪

161
00:09:49,150 --> 00:09:49,790
Get lost.

162
00:09:50,150 --> 00:09:51,320
We're here on our master's orders.

163
00:09:54,610 --> 00:09:55,510
Tell Han Jin,

164
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:57,600
if he wants my service,

165
00:09:58,510 --> 00:09:59,420
leave her alone.

166
00:10:48,120 --> 00:10:48,790
Yun Shao.

167
00:10:49,090 --> 00:10:49,840
Come back with me.

168
00:11:04,240 --> 00:11:05,360
You said

169
00:11:05,600 --> 00:11:06,480
I'm a woman

170
00:11:06,670 --> 00:11:08,120
and should be protected.

171
00:11:08,570 --> 00:11:09,550
That tells me

172
00:11:09,560 --> 00:11:10,840
you're not weak at all.

173
00:11:11,380 --> 00:11:12,530
You value life.

174
00:11:12,870 --> 00:11:13,840
You're kind by nature.

175
00:11:15,530 --> 00:11:17,420
A kind ruler is a blessing
to the people.

176
00:11:21,090 --> 00:11:21,940
What are you watching, Your Highness?

177
00:11:25,650 --> 00:11:26,460
The rain.

178
00:11:26,820 --> 00:11:28,180
It's quite a downpour.

179
00:11:29,890 --> 00:11:30,910
But no matter how hard it rains,

180
00:11:32,420 --> 00:11:34,510
it can't wash away the darkness.

181
00:11:36,320 --> 00:11:37,100
Did Pei Zhao

182
00:11:37,440 --> 00:11:38,470
ever tell you

183
00:11:38,810 --> 00:11:40,410
about your birth mother?

184
00:11:44,490 --> 00:11:46,080
He knew about my mother?

185
00:11:48,250 --> 00:11:49,550
He knew all along.

186
00:11:50,980 --> 00:11:51,910
Nineteen years ago,

187
00:11:52,550 --> 00:11:53,250
my father

188
00:11:53,760 --> 00:11:55,520
took a fancy to the Noble Consort's maid

189
00:11:56,710 --> 00:11:57,740
and wanted to make her a consort.

190
00:11:58,980 --> 00:12:00,270
The Noble Consort grew jealous

191
00:12:00,830 --> 00:12:01,830
and gave her away that very night

192
00:12:01,830 --> 00:12:04,430
to a violent, ugly imperial guard.

193
00:12:05,890 --> 00:12:06,780
A year later,

194
00:12:07,700 --> 00:12:09,190
after suffering terribly,

195
00:12:09,660 --> 00:12:10,760
she died giving birth.

196
00:12:11,910 --> 00:12:12,810
Her newborn daughter

197
00:12:12,820 --> 00:12:14,240
was secretly taken to Mingyu

198
00:12:14,890 --> 00:12:16,560
and raised for blood sacrifice.

199
00:12:17,260 --> 00:12:17,730
Later,

200
00:12:18,820 --> 00:12:20,130
the Yun family took her in.

201
00:12:22,470 --> 00:12:23,120
You mean,

202
00:12:24,480 --> 00:12:25,790
my mother was a palace maid?

203
00:12:28,570 --> 00:12:29,260
I am sorry.

204
00:12:30,720 --> 00:12:32,510
I should have told you long ago.

205
00:12:32,820 --> 00:12:33,550
I just

206
00:12:34,130 --> 00:12:36,470
didn't know how.

207
00:12:36,900 --> 00:12:37,460
After all,

208
00:12:38,180 --> 00:12:39,790
Mother Consort raised me.

209
00:12:40,670 --> 00:12:41,510
Deep down,

210
00:12:42,440 --> 00:12:43,910
I'm still afraid of her.

211
00:12:48,600 --> 00:12:49,430
Do you have proof?

212
00:12:56,200 --> 00:12:57,670
This belonged to your mother.

213
00:12:58,120 --> 00:12:58,870
The name "Shao"

214
00:12:59,000 --> 00:13:00,000
was chosen by her.

215
00:13:00,580 --> 00:13:01,530
It means grace and beauty.

216
00:13:07,520 --> 00:13:08,550
Pei Zhao may fail you.

217
00:13:08,750 --> 00:13:09,970
I never will.

218
00:13:10,990 --> 00:13:12,050
You need not answer me now.

219
00:13:12,270 --> 00:13:13,150
You are free to choose.

220
00:13:13,880 --> 00:13:14,960
But I swear to you.

221
00:13:15,510 --> 00:13:16,810
Whatever you want,

222
00:13:17,860 --> 00:13:19,960
I will do all I can for you.

223
00:13:20,100 --> 00:13:20,790
Say no more.

224
00:13:20,790 --> 00:13:21,600
Yun Shao.

225
00:13:22,720 --> 00:13:24,750
I'll treat you better
than Pei Zhao ever could.

226
00:13:25,240 --> 00:13:25,990
Trust me.

227
00:13:31,670 --> 00:13:32,470
I do.

228
00:13:36,940 --> 00:13:40,700
[Fengyi Bureau]

229
00:13:41,120 --> 00:13:41,870
Lord Pei.

230
00:13:42,120 --> 00:13:45,000
Her Highness sent me
to return these two things.

231
00:13:45,200 --> 00:13:46,550
Her Highness also said,

232
00:13:46,550 --> 00:13:47,670
from this day on,

233
00:13:47,670 --> 00:13:49,550
if Yong has it,

234
00:13:49,550 --> 00:13:50,960
whatever you desire,

235
00:13:50,960 --> 00:13:52,740
Her Highness will grant it.

236
00:13:52,830 --> 00:13:53,490
Her Highness

237
00:13:53,490 --> 00:13:55,120
only wants you happy.

238
00:13:57,250 --> 00:13:58,000
Lord Pei.

239
00:13:58,240 --> 00:14:00,150
Her Highness truly cherishes you.

240
00:14:00,430 --> 00:14:02,910
Do not disappoint her.

241
00:14:03,680 --> 00:14:05,440
She'd better not let me down.

242
00:14:07,020 --> 00:14:08,180
Tell her this.

243
00:14:09,180 --> 00:14:10,690
What she promised me,

244
00:14:11,440 --> 00:14:12,760
she must deliver soon.

245
00:14:24,080 --> 00:14:24,670
Your Highness.

246
00:14:24,900 --> 00:14:27,320
Lord Pei won't even take his medicine.

247
00:14:27,320 --> 00:14:29,380
He looks terribly pale.

248
00:14:33,960 --> 00:14:34,720
Leave.

249
00:14:35,500 --> 00:14:36,120
Yes.

250
00:14:44,290 --> 00:14:46,650
[Prince of Xin'an cannot be trusted]
Zhao wants me to give him the throne.

251
00:14:46,670 --> 00:14:48,720
[Mobilize troops to defend the throne]
Yan would never forgive me.

252
00:14:49,140 --> 00:14:50,790
They're both my sons.

253
00:14:51,270 --> 00:14:52,960
He's making this hard for me on purpose.

254
00:14:56,630 --> 00:14:57,240
Your Highness.

255
00:14:57,240 --> 00:14:58,440
Minister Yun is here.

256
00:15:04,270 --> 00:15:05,080
Your Highness.

257
00:15:05,910 --> 00:15:08,000
That child really is Pei Zhao?

258
00:15:08,200 --> 00:15:08,910
What?

259
00:15:09,970 --> 00:15:12,150
Afraid I'll bring up what you did?

260
00:15:13,180 --> 00:15:14,910
You nearly got my son killed.

261
00:15:14,910 --> 00:15:16,200
I should have killed you.

262
00:15:18,150 --> 00:15:19,720
But I need you now.

263
00:15:20,720 --> 00:15:22,440
I'll spare your worthless life for now.

264
00:15:23,650 --> 00:15:24,190
Your Highness.

265
00:15:24,410 --> 00:15:25,440
Back then,

266
00:15:25,440 --> 00:15:27,080
your father gave the order.

267
00:15:27,080 --> 00:15:29,270
I only obeyed.

268
00:15:29,500 --> 00:15:30,910
I had no choice.

269
00:15:30,910 --> 00:15:32,200
Enough. No more excuses.

270
00:15:32,600 --> 00:15:33,840
If you want to live,

271
00:15:33,840 --> 00:15:35,510
make yourself useful.

272
00:15:35,720 --> 00:15:36,410
Yes.

273
00:15:37,070 --> 00:15:38,390
Find some obedient maids

274
00:15:38,750 --> 00:15:39,750
to care for Zhao.

275
00:15:40,550 --> 00:15:42,550
The Fengyi Bureau is full of men.

276
00:15:42,800 --> 00:15:44,000
They're clumsy.

277
00:15:44,210 --> 00:15:45,330
How can they care for him properly?

278
00:15:45,780 --> 00:15:47,600
But your maids are better
than the Yun Mansion's...

279
00:15:47,600 --> 00:15:48,630
Just do as I say.

280
00:15:49,450 --> 00:15:50,030
Yes.

281
00:15:55,960 --> 00:15:56,870
Give this to Zhao.

282
00:15:58,930 --> 00:16:01,660
I chose
this thousand-year-old ginseng myself.

283
00:16:02,290 --> 00:16:03,550
Damage it even slightly,

284
00:16:04,330 --> 00:16:05,550
and you'll answer to me.

285
00:16:05,970 --> 00:16:06,690
Yes.

286
00:16:28,080 --> 00:16:30,960
Prince of Xin'an cannot be trusted.

287
00:16:31,480 --> 00:16:34,360
Mobilize troops to defend the throne.

288
00:16:54,740 --> 00:16:57,180
[Prince of Xin'an's Residence]

289
00:17:00,900 --> 00:17:01,370
Your Highness.

290
00:17:01,380 --> 00:17:02,390
Minister Yun is here.

291
00:17:03,190 --> 00:17:03,670
Let him in.

292
00:17:08,850 --> 00:17:10,110
Greetings, Your Highness.

293
00:17:11,400 --> 00:17:12,200
What is it?

294
00:17:13,440 --> 00:17:14,920
The Noble Consort

295
00:17:14,920 --> 00:17:16,110
sent this to Pei Zhao.

296
00:17:19,580 --> 00:17:20,420
[Prince of Xin'an cannot be trusted]

297
00:17:20,420 --> 00:17:21,340
[Mobilize troops to defend the throne]

298
00:17:21,350 --> 00:17:22,400
Noble Consort

299
00:17:22,640 --> 00:17:23,680
has grown wary

300
00:17:23,680 --> 00:17:24,930
of Your Highness.

301
00:17:26,070 --> 00:17:26,830
She ordered Pei Zhao

302
00:17:27,030 --> 00:17:28,810
to secretly move troops into the capital

303
00:17:28,810 --> 00:17:30,030
to aid the Emperor.

304
00:17:34,480 --> 00:17:36,180
Without my support

305
00:17:38,010 --> 00:17:39,480
or my clearing the palace of

306
00:17:39,650 --> 00:17:41,280
her rivals and their children,

307
00:17:43,540 --> 00:17:45,830
would she still be Noble Consort?

308
00:17:49,040 --> 00:17:50,430
And now,

309
00:17:52,160 --> 00:17:53,570
she turns on me?

310
00:17:54,900 --> 00:17:56,370
How heartless.

311
00:17:59,170 --> 00:18:00,380
Your Highness,

312
00:18:00,700 --> 00:18:02,000
I am completely loyal to you.

313
00:18:02,180 --> 00:18:03,240
I would never betray you.

314
00:18:03,860 --> 00:18:04,570
The throne

315
00:18:05,410 --> 00:18:07,230
belongs to the capable.

316
00:18:08,210 --> 00:18:10,570
You've fought for Yong for 20 years.

317
00:18:11,350 --> 00:18:12,310
You have every right

318
00:18:12,800 --> 00:18:14,400
to rule Yong.

319
00:18:17,970 --> 00:18:18,530
Do I?

320
00:18:21,540 --> 00:18:22,000
Yes.

321
00:18:37,480 --> 00:18:40,290
♪A cold blade gleams by the window♪

322
00:18:41,910 --> 00:18:45,100
♪Candle tears harden into frost♪

323
00:18:46,420 --> 00:18:48,160
♪Moon shadows flicker and sway♪

324
00:18:48,660 --> 00:18:53,100
♪A wisp of longing haunts the air♪

325
00:18:55,260 --> 00:18:57,930
♪A lone boat rests on the misty river♪

326
00:18:59,150 --> 00:19:04,160
♪That promise lies sealed with my sword♪

327
00:19:04,480 --> 00:19:12,510
♪I turn to find the world in snow♪

328
00:19:12,780 --> 00:19:21,400
♪Fated destiny ties from bygone life♪

329
00:19:21,400 --> 00:19:30,070
♪Longing for one beloved flows on♪

330
00:19:30,450 --> 00:19:39,320
♪I can't let go of the verses lost
across this vast land♪

331
00:19:39,750 --> 00:19:48,240
♪Yet I let go of that fleeting light
within your eyes♪
